突然感到自己很傻
Suddenly I feel very silly.

334
00:21:25,142 --> 00:21:27,250
也不至于用“傻”这个字
Well, "silly" is a strong word.

335
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:30,580
不过不见得不贴切
Not entirely inappropriate, but strong.

336
00:21:36,100 --> 00:21:40,700
杰森，我爱你 我不会欺骗你
Jason, I love you. I could never cheat on you.

337
00:21:41,558 --> 00:21:42,960
是吗？
Yeah?

338
00:21:44,428 --> 00:21:45,728
是的
Yeah.

339
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:53,105
-谢谢你 -不客气
- Well, thank you. - Well, you're welcome.

340
00:21:57,240 --> 00:21:58,916
毛毛虫!
Caterpillars!

341
00:22:02,520 --> 00:22:06,180
-什么？ -本应该研究毛毛虫
- What? - it's obvious. Ben should do caterpillars.

342
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:09,600
-好主意 -谢谢
- Now that's a great idea. - Thanks.

343
00:22:09,600 --> 00:22:11,760
今晚并没有白来
it's a good thing I came down here tonight.

344
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:32,240
本的毛虫研究怎样了？
So, how's Ben doing with his caterpillars?

345
00:22:32,580 --> 00:22:34,780
已经被别人研究过了
Somebody else was already doing caterpillars.

346
00:22:35,220 --> 00:22:36,780
本要想个新课题
Ben had to think of a new project.

347
00:22:37,900 --> 00:22:41,040
新课题？拜托
A new project? Please.

348
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:45,060
很好吃
Pretty good.

349
00:22:57,560 --> 00:23:00,420
我的霉菌实验品呢？
Hey, where's my mold experiment?

350
